Find your part of the UK or Ireland.

Click on one of the rinks or skate groups listed. One of them at least is bound to have lessons.… or at least know someone who can teach.

---

If that doesn't work for you, I fully encourage (and first learnt myself) social media learning!

There  were thousands of tutorials when I first started learning, by now there's probably close to a million or 2 if we include mini TikTok tutorials as well.
